# CaramOS: which apps open office documents. The lists are DEFAULTS in
# /usr/share/caramos-ota/open-document/caramos_open_document.py (caramos-ota); a test keeps the two the same.
#
# CaramOS comes without an office suite: the App Center offers ONLYOFFICE, WPS Office and LibreOffice. Each list
# names those suites first, so the first one installed opens the file. When none is,
# caramos-open-document.desktop opens the file with another app that opens it, or suggests the App Center.
# Without these lists, .docx, .xlsx, .pptx and OpenDocument files, which are zip files, went to the app of
# application/zip. A user's own choice (Open With, Set as default: ~/.config/mimeapps.list) comes first.
[Default Applications]
